          %h3#MapToTateKTheory Maps to K-theory and to Tate K-theory
          %p
            The inclusion of the compactification point (representing the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nodal+curve"} nodal curve
            but being itself the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cusp"} cusp
            of
            = succeed ")" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ℳ
                      %mover
                        %mi ell
                        %mo ¯
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{M}_{\overline{ell}}
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Deligne-Mumford+compactification"} compactified
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+stack+of+elliptic+curves"} moduli stack of elliptic curves
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi ℳ
                    %mover
