            is equivalently the inclusion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+stack+of+1-dimensional+tori"} moduli stack of 1-dimensional tori
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi ℳ
                    %mrow
                      %mn 1
                      %mi dtori
                  %mo =
                  %msub
                    %mi ℳ
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi 𝔾
                        %mi m
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{M}_{1dtori} = \mathcal{M}_{\mathbb{G}_m}
            (
            %a{:href => "#LawsonNaumann12"}> Lawson-Naumann 12, Appendix A
            )
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi ℳ
                    %mrow
